verses.commentary:
37:6 Notice how Isaiah responds to the messengers of Hezekiah with the very words of YHWH (cf. Isa. 37:21)!

▣ "Do not be afraid" This statement (BDB 431, KB 432, Qal IMPERFECT
used in a JUSSIVE sense) is a recurrent message from YHWH to His leaders
(cf. Isa. 7:4; 8:12; 10:24; 35:4; 40:9; 41:10,13,14; 43:1,5; 44:2; 51:7; 54:4; Gen. 15:1; 21:17; 26:24;
46:3; Exod. 20:20; Num. 14:9; Deut. 1:21,29; 3:2,22; 7:18; 20:1,3; 31:6,8; Josh. 8:1; 10:8,25; 11:6;
Jdg. 6:23, etc.).
